400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to live </span><b>authentically</b></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How </span><b>honesty</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is a superpower </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to reclaim the lost art of </span><b>honour</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span></li></ul><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This course has been life changing for the people who have taken it in person and now for the first time it is available in video so you can take your family, small group or organization on the journey to healthy relationships together.</span></p><p><strong>Get started now for just $79!</strong></p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"a8fc721","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Buy Now","link":{"url":"/courses/relationship-matters/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"3890d1a","elType":"section","settings":{"structure":"30","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":0,"bottom":"15","left":0,"isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"391e679","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"2","bottom":"2","left":"2","isLinked":true},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"__globals__":{"border_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[{"id":"13b4efc","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Godfidence","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"f1f7c6c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Building Confidence That Lasts Forever</strong></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Have you ever wished you had more confidence? Life can be a hard task master at times and toxic relationships can really wear you down, including your self-esteem and confidence. When you know your value it results in confidence. However, it is a process of discovery and changing your mindset step by step. In this course, I take you on that journey of discovery. We will explore where your value comes from, and who determines it. We will also look at how shame affects your identity and ultimately your confidence negatively. I will provide you with tools to build confidence that lasts forever.  </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In this 4 session faith-based video series you will learn:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Where </span><b>confidence</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> comes from </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How </span><b>faith</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> can change the way you see yourself </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How </span><b>shame</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> destroys identity and erodes confidence </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to </span><b>build </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">confidence that lasts forever! </span></li></ul><p><strong>Get started now for just $29!</strong></p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"520865a","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Buy Now","link":{"url":"/courses/godfidence-building-confidence-that-lasts-forever/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"b3509da","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"2","bottom":"2","left":"2","isLinked":true},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"__globals__":{"border_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[{"id":"7c806f9","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Understanding Anger ","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"e74b437","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Are you tired of being angry all the time?</strong></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Anger can cause a lot of damage in your relationships, in fact many people who experience anger; face lost relationships, lost jobs and careers and at times, lost freedom because they even get in trouble with authorities. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There is nothing wrong with anger itself, in fact it is an early warning system that lets you know trouble is ahead or that your needs are not being met. It is what you do with anger that makes it good or bad. When anger manages you rather than you managing it, it becomes destructive. In this two part video series, about 3 hours of training, I take you through the cause and effect of anger. Why you struggle with it and how to manage it and even turn it into an advantage for you. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This short course has been an awakening for many people I have taught it too. Now it is available by video in the privacy of your own home. </span></p><p><strong>Get started now for just $29!</strong></p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"199e709","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Buy Now","link":{"url":"/courses/understanding-anger/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"5025781","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":true},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"2","bottom":"2","left":"2","isLinked":true},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"__globals__":{"border_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[{"id":"bb73604","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Overcoming Shame","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ecd9635","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><b>Punching Shame in the Face</b></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Has shame kept you from being content in life? For many people shame is a pervasive force that destroys self-worth and overrides or overshadows happiness and contentment. It sabotages relationships and undermines your ability to believe in yourself or others. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Shame starts from a very young age and sets out to destroy your identity and confidence. Like any bully it needs to be stood up too. In this two video series (About 3 hours of training) I go deep into the cause of shame and how to overcome it and keep it out of your life forever. There are practical tools to give you the skills to punch it right in the face. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This is an emotional journey for those who have taken this course but I have been told over and over it is life changing. It is now available in video format so you can watch it in the privacy of your own home.</span></p><p><strong>Get started now for just $29!</strong></p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"b1adef1","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Buy Now","link":{"url":"/courses/punching-shame-in-the-face/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"be07e27","elType":"section","settings":{"structure":"20"},"elements":[{"id":"7487a5a","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":50,"_inline_size":null,"content_position":"center"},"element